  Node:
  - sentences:
    - text: Some people are so serious. I just like to let loose and see where the
        wind takes me :)
  - sentences:
    - text: I tried to grow an apple earlier today, but it went pear-shaped :(
  - sentences:
    - text: "What\u2019s it like to fly all around the galaxy? It must be so fun,
        I hope I can work for UPS one day!"
